{
  "info": {
    "name": "ChiaTeam Match Media API",
    "description": "Postman collection only for match YouTube sources and timeline highlights.\n\nSetup:\n1. Set `baseUrl` to the deployed API URL.\n2. Set `matchId` to the numeric match ID.\n\nAuthentication:\n- All endpoints in this collection are public and do not require admin headers or an API token.\n- Do not send `createdBy` in the JSON body. The server ignores it.\n\nVideo synchronization: `video time = match timeline time + offsetSeconds`.\n\nError body: `{ \"error\": \"MACHINE_READABLE_CODE\", \"message\": \"Optional message\" }`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8787",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "matchId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "highlightId",
      "value": "5",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Video Sources",
      "description": "Each match supports zero, one, or two YouTube sources. Slots can only be 1 or 2.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Video Sources",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Response contains sources', function () {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(data.matchId).to.eql(Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('matchId')));",
                  "  pm.expect(data.sources).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Public endpoint.\n\nExample response:\n```json\n{\n  \"matchId\": 1,\n  \"sources\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 3,\n      \"slot\": 1,\n      \"provider\": \"youtube\",\n      \"videoId\": \"5enTofQyWG0\",\n      \"url\": \"https://youtu.be/5enTofQyWG0\",\n      \"title\": \"Cam 1\",\n      \"offsetSeconds\": 0,\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-29T14:51:28.806Z\",\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-07-29T14:51:28.806Z\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nReturns `404 MATCH_NOT_FOUND` when the match does not exist.",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/matches/by-id/{{matchId}}/video-sources",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "matches",
                "by-id",
                "{{matchId}}",
                "video-sources"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Replace All Video Sources",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Two sources were returned', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().sources).to.have.lengthOf(2);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Public endpoint. This replaces the complete source collection in one transaction. Existing slots omitted from the body are deleted. An empty `sources` array removes all sources. Do not send `videoId`; the server extracts it from `url`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"sources\": [\n    {\n      \"slot\": 1,\n      \"provider\": \"youtube\",\n      \"url\": \"https://youtu.be/5enTofQyWG0\",\n      \"title\": \"Cam 1\",\n      \"offsetSeconds\": 0\n    },\n    {\n      \"slot\": 2,\n      \"provider\": \"youtube\",\n      \"url\": \"https://youtu.be/8raVsHcoCz0\",\n      \"title\": \"Cam 2\",\n      \"offsetSeconds\": 260\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/matches/by-id/{{matchId}}/video-sources",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "matches",
                "by-id",
                "{{matchId}}",
                "video-sources"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Highlights",
      "description": "Highlights belong to the match timeline. They are ordered by `timestampSeconds`, then ID.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get All Highlights",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Response contains highlights', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().highlights).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Public endpoint.\n\nExample response:\n```json\n{\n  \"matchId\": 1,\n  \"highlights\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 5,\n      \"matchId\": 1,\n      \"timestampSeconds\": 823,\n      \"timestamp\": \"13:43\",\n      \"caption\": \"Nong Thổ 20\",\n      \"preferredSourceSlot\": 1,\n      \"createdBy\": \"worker\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-29T14:51:29.656Z\",\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-07-29T14:51:29.656Z\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nReturns `404 MATCH_NOT_FOUND` when the match does not exist.",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/matches/by-id/{{matchId}}/highlights",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "matches", "by-id", "{{matchId}}", "highlights"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Highlights by Source Slot",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Public endpoint. `sourceSlot` can only be `1` or `2`.",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/matches/by-id/{{matchId}}/highlights?sourceSlot=1",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "matches", "by-id", "{{matchId}}", "highlights"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "sourceSlot",
                  "value": "1"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Highlight",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 201', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.highlight && data.highlight.id != null) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('highlightId', String(data.highlight.id));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Public endpoint. Returns `201`. The test saves the returned ID in `highlightId`. `createdBy` is ignored if sent in the body.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"timestampSeconds\": 930,\n  \"caption\": \"Bàn thắng siêu phẩm sút xa của Tú\",\n  \"preferredSourceSlot\": 1\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/matches/by-id/{{matchId}}/highlights",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "matches", "by-id", "{{matchId}}", "highlights"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Highlight",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Public partial update. Allowed fields are `timestampSeconds`, `caption`, and `preferredSourceSlot`. At least one field is required.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"caption\": \"Updated highlight caption\",\n  \"preferredSourceSlot\": 2\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/matches/by-id/{{matchId}}/highlights/{{highlightId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "matches",
                "by-id",
                "{{matchId}}",
                "highlights",
                "{{highlightId}}"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete One Highlight",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Delete succeeded', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.eql({ ok: true });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Public endpoint. Deletes only when both `matchId` and `highlightId` match. Returns `404 HIGHLIGHT_NOT_FOUND` when absent.",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/matches/by-id/{{matchId}}/highlights/{{highlightId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "matches",
                "by-id",
                "{{matchId}}",
                "highlights",
                "{{highlightId}}"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DANGER - Delete All Highlights",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Delete succeeded', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().ok).to.eql(true);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "description": "DANGER: Public endpoint. Deletes every highlight for the match. Example response: `{ \"ok\": true, \"deletedCount\": 7 }`.",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/matches/by-id/{{matchId}}/highlights",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "matches", "by-id", "{{matchId}}", "highlights"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
